 "description": "Query rows from a datos.gov.co dataset using SoQL. datasetId is the Socrata 4x4 code from search_datasets. SoQL clauses: $select (columns / aggregates like \"count(*)\"), $where (SQL-like filter, e.g. \"departamento_nom='BOGOTA' AND edad > 60\"), $order (\"count desc\"), $group, $q (full-text across the row). Use dataset_columns first to learn field names. Returns an array of row objects keyed by field name. Default $limit is 50 (Socrata max per page is 50000).",
 "inputSchema": {
  "examples": [
   {
    "$group": "departamento_nom",
    "$order": "count desc",
    "$select": "departamento_nom, count(*)",
    "datasetId": "gt2j-8ykr"
   },
   {
    "$limit": 100,
    "$select": "fecha, valor",
    "$where": "departamento_nom='BOGOTA' AND fecha >= '2023-01-01'",
    "datasetId": "gt2j-8ykr"
   }
  ],
  "properties": {
   "$group": {
    "description": "Group-by field(s) for aggregation.",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "$limit": {
    "description": "Rows to return (default 50).",
    "type": "number"
   },
   "$offset": {
    "description": "Pagination offset (default 0).",
    "type": "number"
   },
   "$order": {
    "description": "Sort, e.g. \"fecha_reporte_web desc\".",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "$q": {
    "description": "Full-text search across the whole row.",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "$select": {
    "description": "Columns or aggregates, e.g. \"departamento_nom, count(*)\".",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "$where": {
    "description": "SQL-like filter, e.g. \"edad > 60 AND sexo='F'\".",
    "type": "string"
   },
   "datasetId": {
    "description": "Socrata 4x4 id, e.g. \"gt2j-8ykr\".",
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "datasetId"
  ],
  "type": "object"
 },
 "name": "query_dataset",
 "title": "Query Dataset",
 "version": "v1.571babf4"
